      "en": "This demanding circular route to Torre del Carnizoso starts from Sotres, passing through Collado de Pandébano and Refugio de la Terenosa. The ascent continues via Collado Vallejo to Refugio Urriellu before reaching the summit.\n\nThe return journey descends through Jou del Carnizoso, Collado Camburero, Collado de las Moñas, and Collado Cuaceya, offering varied terrain and extensive views. With 18.1 km and 1743m of elevation gain, this is a long and strenuous day suitable for experienced hikers.",
